// -> adaptive HLS masters (multi-language incl. Hindi). Live-verified Oct 18
// 2026 (8 streams for Dune 2; master.m3u8 plays with Referer=embed page).
// Node/undici is TLS-fingerprint-blocked by their edge; the app's WebView
// (real Chromium network stack) passes like curl does.
